# Full-text packages (incubator)

`@graviola/fulltext-search-core` and `@graviola/meilisearch-sparql-store` are **domain-agnostic**: any JSON Schema + `@graviola/search-facet-schema` sidecar.

## Do not

- Add `legacy*` options, deprecated aliases, or compatibility shims in library **src**.
- Hardcode Semantic Desktop / graviola-indexer type names, field names, migration hints, or deployment assumptions in library **src** or comments.
- Encode old-index behavior in the framework layer.

Tests may use domain fixtures (e.g. Manifestation) to simulate a consumer app.

## Do

- Keep generic hooks: `adaptFiltersForLiveIndex`, `indexSchemaMismatchHint`, `idCodec` / `idCodecForType`, `indexNameForType`, live-settings probe.
- Put deployment- or product-specific filter/id/index adaptations in **apps** (e.g. `apps/fulltext-sd/server/`).
- Prefer **breaking API changes** on 0.x over carrying legacy surface in libraries — almost no external consumers yet.
